  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bibliografi stadsjordbruk</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bibliography urb agricult</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till framtagande av annoterad bibliografi f&#xf6;r stadsjordbruk. Syftet &#xe4;r att ge alla involverade p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det en &#xf6;verblick av tillg&#xe4;nglig litteratur med olika aspekter p&#xe5; stadsjordbruk, som policy, forskning,projekt planering/-genomf&#xf6;rande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the production of an annotated bibliography on urban agri culture. The aim is to provide a wide range of stakeholders in urban development an overview of existing literature on various aspects of urban agriculture, as a support to research, policy formulation and project planning and implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
